# D2b tier 1: the font files carried in the binary, as basename patterns (one `*` each)
# matched against the pinned file list (scripts/texlive/files.tsv). The set is what most
# documents use: Computer Modern and the AMS fonts (text, math, symbols, Fraktur), Latin
# Modern (T1 text with lmodern), and the URW clones of the PostScript base fonts (Times,
# Helvetica, Courier, Palatino, Symbol), with the encodings their map lines name.
cm*.pfb
msam*.pfb
msbm*.pfb
eu*.pfb
lm*.pfb
utm*.pfb
uhv*.pfb
ucr*.pfb
upl*.pfb
usy*.pfb
uzd*.pfb
lm-*.enc
8r.enc
# article's TS1 text font (tcrm1000 is cm-super's sfrm1000 through its TS1 encoding).
sfrm1000.pfb
cm-super-ts1.enc
